>  \"allocations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"party\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"merchant_A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"account_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"va_merchant_A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1000.00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TXN-AGG-20260927\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"party\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"merchant_B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"account_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"va_merchant_B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"250.00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TXN-AGG-20260927\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"party\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"platform_opco\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"account_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"platform_fee_acct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"37.50\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FEE-SCHEDULE-V3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1287.50\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"checks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"allocations_sum_equals_total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"no_platform_discretion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reserve_held_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"licensed_psp\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"audit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T09:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"created_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"settlement_engine\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份指令里有三个字段是合规意义上的关键。<code>executed_by.role = fund_controller</code> 明确资金控制方是持牌机构而非平台，这是法律定性的书面证据。<code>no_platform_discretion: true</code> 断言平台没有对资金去向的裁量权——这个字段如果为 false，说明分账规则里包含了平台可自由调整的部分（例如自定义的保证金留存比例），需要重新审视。<code>reserve_held_by</code> 指明保证金/留存资金由谁持有：由持牌方持有则平台不承担资金责任，由平台持有则重新落回资金池。<code>idempotency_key</code> 处理的是重试安全：分账指令的执行是资金副作用，重复执行必须被幂等吸收，而不能靠事后对账发现重复出款再冲正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>二清判定只看三个事实：<strong>资金是否在平台控制的账户上停留、平台是否决定资金去向与时点、平台是否无牌承担了资金转移或结算职能</strong>。三项全「是」即构成。</li>\n<li><strong>从资金占用中获益</strong>（利差、挪用周转）是监管区分技术服务与实质清算的辅助证据，也是最容易滑向挪用资金的路径。</li>\n<li>「资金池 + 净额结算」的危险来自三个叠加效应：池子污染全局账务、平台获得裁量权、<strong>缺口被业务增长掩盖</strong>直到增长放缓。</li>\n<li>四条成立的不过平台路径：<strong>支付机构分账、商户直连收单、银行虚拟账户、监管账户+指令制</strong>；共同原则是<strong>资金流与信息流分离</strong>。</li>\n<li>注意指令发起权本身可能构成支付发起服务（PIS）而需要单独授权。</li>\n<li>分账指令必须是自解释、幂等、可审计的；<code>executed_by.role</code>、<code>no_platform_discretion</code>、<code>reserve_held_by</code> 三个字段构成法律定性的书面证据，<code>idempotency_key</code> 防止重试造成重复出款。</li>\n<li>资金路径确定后，需要用日终对账证明存管持续足额——见 <a href=\"safeguard-reconcile-report\">存管对账与监管报送</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"资金池二清红线与不过平台路径","id":"资金池二清红线与不过平台路径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：判定的三个问句","id":"核心概念-判定的三个问句"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么「资金池 + 净额结算」是最危险的设计","id":"为什么-资金池-净额结算-是最危险的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么第一版设计总是长成这样","id":"为什么第一版设计总是长成这样"},{"level":3,"text":"唯一的判定原则","id":"唯一的判定原则"},{"level":2,"text":"四种成立的「不过平台」路径","id":"四种成立的-不过平台-路径"},{"level":3,"text":"路径一：支付机构分账","id":"路径一-支付机构分账"},{"level":3,"text":"路径二：商户直连收单","id":"路径二-商户直连收单"},{"level":3,"text":"路径三：银行虚拟账户结构","id":"路径三-银行虚拟账户结构"},{"level":3,"text":"路径四：监管账户加指令制","id":"路径四-监管账户加指令制"},{"level":2,"text":"分账指令的数据模型","id":"分账指令的数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"备付金/客户资金隔离存管","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-license-compliance/customer-fund-safeguard/float-safeguard-segregation"},"next":{"title":"存管对账与监管报送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-license-compliance/customer-fund-safeguard/safeguard-reconcile-report"}}